# Copy to scripts/.substrate-retention (gitignored) and fill in.
# check-substrate-retention.sh reads these three and measures against them. It never copies
# anything: choosing, paying for and configuring the destination is yours, and so is key custody.

# Where the substrate is backed up. The checker only reads the mtime of the newest file here.
# BACKUP_DEST=/Volumes/backup/task-repository

# A backup older than this many days makes the checker exit 1.
# MAX_BACKUP_AGE_DAYS=7

# Archived tasks older than this are counted and reported. Deleting them is your decision.
# ARCHIVE_MAX_AGE_DAYS=365
